            <h2>Tips</h2>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Practice solo first, rehearse together later.</strong> Book a small room to work on your own parts, then book the large room when the full band is ready. Cheaper than practicing your part in a large room.</li>
              <li><strong>Rehearse before you record.</strong> Get tight in the rehearsal room first, then book the Control Room for recording. Don't pay recording studio rates for rehearsal time.</li>
              <li><strong>Visit before you book.</strong> Not sure which room fits? Stop by and take a look. Open daily 10:00 AM to 10:00 PM.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Ready to book?</h2>
            <p>Thunder Studio has a <a href={`/${lang}/rooms/small-room`}>Small Room</a> for solo practice, a <a href={`/${lang}/rooms/large-room`}>Large Room</a> for full bands, and a <a href={`/${lang}/rooms/control-room`}>Control Room</a> for recording. All rooms come fully equipped. Open daily 10:00 AM to 10:00 PM in Bang Khen, Bangkok.</p>
          </div>
